{
  "title": "Meta's New AI Shops for You. Amazon Said No.",
  "chapters": [],
  "lines": [
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "Your next shopping trip might not be done by you,",
      "emphasis": "by you",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "shopping cart",
        "robot"
      ],
      "label": "WHO SHOPS",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "because Meta just built an AI that buys things for you.",
      "emphasis": "buys",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "phone",
        "shopping bag"
      ],
      "label": "META",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "Follow GOLIDE, because the feed won't show us to you twice,",
      "emphasis": "Follow GOLIDE",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": true
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "and we unpack one AI update like this every day.",
      "emphasis": "every day",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": true
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "It's called Muse, launched in September in the US.",
      "emphasis": "Muse",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "MUSE",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "You tell it what you need, a gift, a jacket, a new charger,",
      "emphasis": "what you need",
      "visual": "icon_flow",
      "subjects": [
        "gift box",
        "jacket",
        "phone charger"
      ],
      "label": "YOU ASK",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "and it searches stores like Walmart, Best Buy and Gap,",
      "emphasis": "Walmart",
      "visual": "icon_orbit",
      "subjects": [
        "robot",
        "shop",
        "shopping bag"
      ],
      "label": "IT SEARCHES",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "fills the cart, then asks you to approve before it pays.",
      "emphasis": "approve",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "shopping cart",
        "check mark"
      ],
      "label": "YOU APPROVE",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "And now every store has to decide whether to let AI shoppers in.",
      "emphasis": "AI shoppers",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "shop",
        "robot"
      ],
      "label": "THE SHIFT",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "Shopify is building checkouts for them,",
      "emphasis": "Shopify",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "shopping cart",
        "robot"
      ],
      "label": "OPEN DOOR",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "but Amazon has blocked Muse from its site.",
      "emphasis": "Amazon",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "robot",
        "closed door"
      ],
      "label": "BLOCKED",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "So a store that shuts the door could lose your sale,",
      "emphasis": "lose",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "shop",
        "shopping bag"
      ],
      "label": "THE COST",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "because your AI buys from one that lets it in.",
      "emphasis": "lets it in",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "robot",
        "shop"
      ],
      "label": "THE COST",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "reframe",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "In other words, a store's next customer may be an AI.",
      "emphasis": "an AI",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "robot"
      ],
      "label": "NEW CUSTOMER",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "Before you hand it your card, check two things,",
      "emphasis": "two things",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "credit card"
      ],
      "label": "CHECK FIRST",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "what it can buy without asking, and where it's allowed to shop.",
      "emphasis": "without asking",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "checklist"
      ],
      "label": "CHECK FIRST",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "Would you let an AI do your shopping?",
      "emphasis": "your shopping",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "question mark"
      ],
      "label": "YOUR CALL",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "Because your next shopping trip might not be done by you.",
      "emphasis": "by you",
      "visual": "logo_end",
      "subjects": [
        "shopping cart"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    }
  ]
